# /etc/deepwave/deepwave.env, read by deepwave.service. Every flag: `deepwave --help` and
# docs/configuration.md.
#
# Trust root: mainnet's genesis.blob (the file sui-node reads). The first start restores the newest
# formal snapshot; later starts resume the store (--snapshot is ignored once the store holds a
# checkpoint). Sources: Mysten's public checkpoint bucket and live stream (no credentials) plus
# p2p state sync from the seed peers (tools/p2p/seeds.sh prints the --p2p value).
DEEPWAVE_ARGS=run --dir /var/lib/deepwave --genesis /etc/deepwave/genesis.blob --snapshot latest --snapshot-threads 16 --mode execute --indexes --p2p <seed peers from tools/p2p/seeds.sh> --serve 0.0.0.0:9000 --metrics 127.0.0.1:9184
# Or run from sui-node's config: DEEPWAVE_ARGS=--config-path /etc/deepwave/fullnode.yaml
